            "text": "A decimolar solution potassium ferrocyanide is $50 \\%$ dissociated at 300 K . The osmotic pressure of solution is $\\left(R=8.314 \\mathrm{JK}^{-1} \\mathrm{~mol}^{-1}\\right)$",
