              "isCorrect": false
            }
          ],
          "correctValue": null,
          "solution": {
            "text": "$\\alpha=0.5$ (50\\% dissociated)\nThe reaction involves is\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/b1M_7YrgLHM_mVudRlR4zl-Q_1PFYW3Edez6iDF0NL4.original.fullsize.png\"/>\nTotal moles at equilibrium $=1-\\alpha+4 \\alpha+\\alpha$\n$\\text { Total }=1+4 \\alpha$\n$\\therefore$ van't Hoff factor $(i)=\\frac{1+4 \\alpha}{1}=1+4 \\times 0.5=3$\nOsmotic pressure, $\\pi=i C R T$\n$\\begin{aligned}\nC & =0.1 \\mathrm{M}=10^2 \\mathrm{~mol} \\mathrm{~m}^{-3} \\\\\n\\pi & =3 \\times 10^2 \\times 8.314 \\times 300 \\\\\n& =7.483 \\times 10^5 \\mathrm{Nm}^{-2}\n\\end{aligned}$\nor\n$\\pi=7.48 \\mathrm{~atm}$",
            "image": null
